    <title>CMPSS-Lite</title>
      <sectiondef kind="func">
      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__cmpss__lite__api_1gac68327c52ae4e9d00fc01fa6307010d9" prot="public" static="yes" const="no" explicit="no" inline="yes" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>static void CMPSSLITE_configDAC</definition>
        <argsstring>(uint32_t base, uint16_t config)</argsstring>
        <name>CMPSSLITE_configDAC</name>
        <param>
          <type>uint32_t</type>
          <declname>base</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>uint16_t</type>
          <declname>config</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Sets the configuration for the internal comparator DACs.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>base</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>is the base address of the CMPSSLITE module. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>config</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>is the configuration of the internal DAC.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
This function configures the comparator&apos;s internal DAC. The <emphasis>config</emphasis> parameter configures the DAC value load trigger event between SYSCLK and MCPWMSYNCPER i.e. the CMPSS_DACVAL_xxx value.</para>
<para>The <bold>CMPSS_DACVAL_xxx</bold> term can take on the following values to specify when the DAC value is loaded from its shadow register:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>CMPSS_DACVAL_SYSCLK</bold> - Value register updated on system clock.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>CMPSS_DACVAL_PWMSYNC</bold> - Value register updated on PWM sync.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>None. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
